---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="CNG Conversion - Taqwa Automobile Service Center"
  description="Certified CNG conversion in Uttara, Dhaka. Safety-tested cylinder installation, genuine kits, ECU tuning and 2 year warranty at Taqwa Automobile Service Center."
  path="cng-conversion.html"
  current="services"
>

<style define:vars={{ heroBg: `url(${base}img/hero-background.jpg)` }}>
  /* Everything shared with the rest of the site (tokens, reset, header,
     mobile nav, buttons/eyebrow, footer, why-choose, our-environment,
     our-features, our-latest-news, services-recap section, hybrid service
     process, the about-style CTA banner, and the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item/.hybrid-illustration selectors) now lives in
     src/styles/global.css. The "car wash", "our services", "our
     environment/features", "story", "stats" and "team" blocks that used to
     be duplicated here were dead CSS — this page never renders those
     sections — and have been dropped. Only the declarations genuinely
     specific to this page remain below. */

  /* Hero image needs the base-path-aware URL (global.css's .hero can't use
     Astro's define:vars); this page's hero paragraph is also a dimmer
     "muted" gray rather than global.css's near-white default. */
  .hero{
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(16,19,24,0.65), rgba(16,19,24,0.75)),
      var(--heroBg) center/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .hero-copy p{color:var(--muted);}

  /* This page's header collapses to the hamburger menu at 980px, not
     global.css's default 1024px — restore the full nav in that gap. */
  @media (min-width:981px) and (max-width:1024px){
    nav.main-nav > ul{display:flex;}
    .hamburger{display:none;}
    .call-btn{display:flex;}
  }

  /* This page's hybrid-section reuses the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item pattern with its own background-glow position and a
     wider hybrid-grid/hybrid-features-strip than the homepage's default. */
  .hybrid-panel::before{mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 75% 50%, black, transparent);}
  .hybrid-grid{gap:26px 22px;}
  .hybrid-features-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);}

  /* This page's FAQ accordion uses a snappier, non-eased transition than the
     smoother default in global.css — preserved exactly as before. */
  .faq-question{transition:none;}
  .faq-question .faq-arrow::before, .faq-question .faq-arrow::after{
    transition:transform .25s ease, opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .faq-answer{transition:max-height .3s ease;}

  /* This page's inner-page banner uses a real photo background instead of
     global.css's default subtle grid-texture, plus its own fixed sizing. */
  .page-banner{
    background:linear-gradient(150deg, #18263A 0%, #0A0F17 100%);
    padding:68px 32px 58px;
  }
  .page-banner::before{
    background-image:url("img/background-2.jpg");
    background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;
    mask-image:none;
  }
  .page-banner h1{font-size:44px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .page-banner{padding:44px 20px 40px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:30px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:420px){
    .page-banner{padding:36px 16px 32px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:25px;}
  }
</style>


<section class="page-banner">
  <div class="page-banner-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">OUR CORE SPECIALTY</div>
    <h1 class="display">CNG <span class="accent">CONVERSION</span></h1>
    <p style="color:var(--off); font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; max-width:620px; margin:0 auto 20px;">Certified, safety-tested CNG conversion for private cars and commercial vehicles — genuine kits, careful installation, and real fuel savings from day one.</p>
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">»</span>
      <span class="current">CNG Conversion</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-section" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="hybrid-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-panel">

      <div class="hybrid-header">
        <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">GAS CONVERSION IS <span class="accent">WHAT WE DO BEST</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-content">
        <div class="story-content" style="position:relative;">
          <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px;">CNG conversion isn't a side job at Taqwa Automobile — it's our core specialty. Every cylinder installation, injector fitting and pressure test is handled by our dedicated gas conversion team, following the same careful process on every single car.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Whether you drive daily in city traffic or run a commercial vehicle, converting to CNG can cut your fuel cost significantly while keeping performance smooth — as long as the conversion is done right. That's where we come in.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hybrid-illustration">
          <img src={base + "img/lpg-and-cng.jpg"} alt="CNG conversion installation at Taqwa Automobile" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-grid" style="margin-top:30px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); position:relative;">

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11l-1.3 8L18.5 9.5H12z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Lower Running Cost</h4>
            <p>CNG is among the cheapest fuels on the road, meaning noticeably lower cost per kilometer compared to petrol.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s7-6.5 7-11.5a7 7 0 10-14 0C5 14.5 12 21 12 21z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.3" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Widely Available Refills</h4>
            <p>CNG filling stations are common across Dhaka, making it a practical everyday fuel choice for daily driving.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0113-6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17 6l-1-3.5L20 4" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 01-13 6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 18l1 3.5L4 20" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Cleaner Emissions</h4>
            <p>CNG burns cleaner than petrol, producing fewer harmful emissions — better for the environment and engine health.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="8" y2="22" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="18" x2="16" y2="22" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Durable, Long-Lasting Cylinder</h4>
            <p>Quality cylinders built for daily, high-mileage driving, backed by our own installation and safety checks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-features-strip">
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Certified Conversion Kits</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Safety-Checked Installation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>2 Year Service Warranty</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Experienced Gas Conversion Specialists</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Government Safety Standard Compliant</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Honest Fuel-Type Advice</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-process-section">
  <div class="hybrid-process-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-process-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR CNG <span class="accent">CONVERSION PROCESS</span></h2>
      <p>From first inspection to final road test, every CNG conversion at Taqwa Automobile follows the same careful, safety-first process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-process-steps">

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">01</div>
        <h3>Free Consultation &amp; Inspection</h3>
        <p>We check your engine and driving pattern to confirm CNG is the right fit and explain what to expect before we begin.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">02</div>
        <h3>Kit &amp; Cylinder Selection</h3>
        <p>We help you choose the right cylinder size and injection kit based on your vehicle and how you drive.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">03</div>
        <h3>Certified Installation</h3>
        <p>Our trained technicians fit the cylinder, injectors, reducer and wiring with precision, following manufacturer guidelines.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">04</div>
        <h3>Leak &amp; Pressure Testing</h3>
        <p>Every connection is pressure tested and leak checked before your car is cleared as safe to drive on CNG.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">05</div>
        <h3>ECU Tuning &amp; Road Test</h3>
        <p>We fine-tune the system for smooth performance, then take your car out for a real road test on CNG.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">06</div>
        <h3>Warranty &amp; Ongoing Support</h3>
        <p>We back every conversion with a 2 year service warranty and are always available for follow-up checks.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-recap-section">
  <div class="services-recap-inner">
    <div class="services-recap-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR <span class="accent">CNG SERVICES</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card">
