        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>CNG Cylinder Installation</h3>
          <p>Safe, precise fitting of certified CNG cylinders sized to match your vehicle and driving needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h4V6h4v12h4V6h4v12h4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Injector Kit Fitting</h3>
          <p>Careful installation of injector and wiring kits for smooth, reliable gas delivery to the engine.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="14.5" y1="14.5" x2="20" y2="20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 10h1.5l1-2 1.5 4 1-2H13" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Pressure &amp; Leak Testing</h3>
          <p>Every conversion is pressure tested and leak checked before your car is cleared as safe to drive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 8h8v8H8z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M12 3v2M12 19v2M3 12h2M19 12h2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>ECU Remapping &amp; Tuning</h3>
          <p>Precise software tuning so your engine runs smoothly and efficiently on CNG.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Cylinder Re-testing &amp; Renewal</h3>
          <p>Periodic cylinder re-testing and certification renewal to keep your vehicle compliant and safe.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0113-6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17 6l-1-3.5L20 4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 01-13 6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 18l1 3.5L4 20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Reducer &amp; Regulator Service</h3>
          <p>Inspection and servicing of the gas reducer and regulator for consistent pressure and performance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11l-1.3 8L18.5 9.5H12z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Conversion Kit Upgrade</h3>
          <p>Upgrade an older CNG kit to a newer, more efficient system for better mileage and reliability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M12 3.5a8.5 8.5 0 018.5 8.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M22 8l-1.5-2L18 7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>CNG System Troubleshooting</h3>
          <p>Diagnosing power loss, rough idling or gas-switching issues in existing CNG-converted vehicles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why-choose-section">
  <div class="why-choose-inner">

    <div class="why-choose-content">
      <div class="eyebrow-line">Why Trust Us</div>
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.3px;">With Your <span class="accent">CNG Conversion</span>?</h2>
